        <h2>1. Definitions</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Pro assets:</strong> the icons marked Pro and any other material that is only available in the Kit (<code>@dotwear/kit</code> and its counterparts for other platforms).</li>
          <li><strong>Subscription:</strong> a paid Dotwear Pro plan, such as Solo.</li>
          <li><strong>Seat:</strong> one named person. Solo includes one seat.</li>
          <li><strong>End product:</strong> something you make that uses Pro assets as part of a larger work: an app, a website, software, a game, a document or a presentation.</li>
