          <li>Share your token, or let more people use the Kit than you have seats.</li>
          <li>Use Pro assets in a trademark, a logo or a brand identity.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Shipping the Kit inside your end product's build (for example a bundled web app or a compiled mobile app) is
          fine, as long as the icons are not offered for others to reuse.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          If Dotwear Pro is not right for you, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> within
          {REFUND_DAYS} days of your purchase for a full refund. After a refund, the license ends and your token stops
          working.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Ownership</h2>
        <p>Dotwear keeps all rights to the Pro assets. This license does not transfer ownership.</p>

        <h2>7. No warranty</h2>
        <p>
          Pro assets are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, to the extent permitted by law.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by law, Dotwear's total liability is limited to the fees you paid in the 12 months
          before the claim.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Termination</h2>
        <p>
          If you break this license, it ends and your token may be revoked. Sections 4, 6, 7 and 8 continue to apply.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this license. Changes apply to versions released after the change; the license you accepted
          continues to cover the versions you already have.
        </p>

